id=snap-daily
name=snap-daily
version=v1.6
versionCode=7
author=pantha704
description=05:00 IST camera snap to a Snapchat group. Installs scripts + busybox crond; not an LSPosed hook. watch.sh decides the daily fire by comparing IST time (crond matches UTC), so the schedule never drifts. 3 attempts inside 05:00-06:00 IST, battery floor, one-snap-per-day guard, PIN self-heal, crond watchdog, keepalive for tailscaled/adb/ssh/wifi. Every beat is logged to logs/watch_<date>.log and a day that closes with no send raises a Telegram alarm. Tested on a rooted OnePlus 7T (HD1901).
